{"total":178,"totalPage":4,"page":2,"pageSize":50,"items":[{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07922","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4012,"bookHadithIndex":51,"text":"– Сообщается, что Рафи‘ ибн Хадидж (да будет доволен им Аллах) сказал: «Я слышал, как Пророк ﷺговорил: “Скверны деньги, (полученные за) собаку, и скверны деньги, (заработанные) блудницей, и скверен заработок цирюльника”»","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07923","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4013,"bookHadithIndex":52,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07924","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4014,"bookHadithIndex":53,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07925","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4015,"bookHadithIndex":54,"text":"Сообщается, что Абу аз-Зубайр сказал: «Я спросил Джабира о продаже собак и кошек и он сказал: “Пророк ﷺ строго запретил это/заджара/!”»","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07926","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4016,"bookHadithIndex":55,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07927","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4017,"bookHadithIndex":56,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07928","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4018,"bookHadithIndex":57,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07929","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4019,"bookHadithIndex":58,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f0792a","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4020,"bookHadithIndex":59,"text":"– Передают, что Джабир ибн ‘Абдуллах, да будет доволен Аллах ими обоими, сказал: «(Сначала) Посланник Аллаха ﷺ велел нам убивать собак, и даже когда из пустыни приходила женщина со своей собакой, мы уби­вали её (собаку). А потом Пророк ﷺ запретил нам убивать их и сказал: “Вам следует (убивать только) совершенно чёрных собак с двумя (белыми) пят­нами (над глазами, ибо), поистине, (каждая такая собака) шайтан”»","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f0792b","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4021,"bookHadithIndex":60,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f0792c","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4022,"bookHadithIndex":61,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f0792d","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4023,"bookHadithIndex":62,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f0792e","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4024,"bookHadithIndex":63,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f0792f","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4025,"bookHadithIndex":64,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07930","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4026,"bookHadithIndex":65,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07931","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4027,"bookHadithIndex":66,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07932","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4028,"bookHadithIndex":67,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07933","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4029,"bookHadithIndex":68,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07934","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4030,"bookHadithIndex":69,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07935","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4031,"bookHadithIndex":70,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07936","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":22,"hadithIndex":4032,"bookHadithIndex":71,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c8